Still 1.2.0. Two small things in the pocket panel.

The handle now wears the slider's colour — green while pocket mode is off, red while it is on — so the notch alone says which state the phone is in when the panel is pulled down.

And the countdown bar moves smoothly instead of stepping once a second. The figure beside it still comes from the counter that actually closes the microphone; only the tenths between its ticks are drawn in, ten times a second.
